docs/SCRIPT-UPDATE-PROPOSAL.md
docs/SCRIPT-UPDATE-SUMMARY.md
docs/ADR-CLEANUP-PLAN.md
docs/ADR-CLEANUP-SUMMARY.md

# Test result documents (internal)
docs/*-TEST-RESULTS.md
docs/TIER*-TEST*.md

# MkDocs build output
site/

# MkDocs hook artifacts (copied during build, cleaned after)
docs/index.md
docs/design-doc.md
docs/contributing.md
docs/changelog.md
docs/code-of-conduct.md
docs/hooks/__pycache__/
